  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CombFockTranslate.isFockVacAt_comb | exact GlobalTheory.CombFockTranslate.isFockVacAt_comb | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CombFockTranslate.isFockVacAt_comb <;> assumption)
